24-01-10 16:00:51.000',1162,10176,'FormE2023SAS0137','FormE2023SAS0137','5101','9101','The layout plan uploaded at the time of registration is dated 26.12.2019. The layout plan uploaded for extension u/s 6 is dated 24.09.2022 which is a revised layout which is still under process with this Authority and has not yet been approved. You are asked to get the revision approved and then apply for extension u/s 6.','N','','','',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:00:51.000','os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:00:51.000'),(4750,'os.projects1','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2024-01-10 16:17:27.000',1162,10176,'FormE2023SAS0137','FormE2023SAS0137','5101','9107','Though Architect Certificate is provided but the khasra no.s mentioned in it are not co-relating to the CLU Certificate. Therefore, you are asked to provide the Architect Certificate having khasra no.s as mentioned in the CLU Certificate.','N','','','',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:17:27.000','os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:17:27.000'),(4751,'os.projects1','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2024-01-10 16:25:58.000',1006,11269,'FormE2023SAS0124','FormE2023SAS0124','5101','9104','You have submitted the explanation that the main project is completed and thus Commencement certificate for Mega project cannot be submitted. Even though the entire JLPL project is complete and it was exempted from completion vide letter of GMADA dated 20.04.2015 you are seeking extension for your incomplete project and since it is a part of a Mega project you have to submit the Extension in implementation period in Mega Project or any other document which shows the validation only of your specific project granted by the Government in which the time limit is extended at least up to the date of the extension required under section 6 of the Act. You have submitted the agreement between Government and JLPL. ','N','','','',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:25:58.000','os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:25:58.000'),(4752,'os.projects1','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2024-01-10 16:27:30.000',1006,11269,'FormE2023SAS0124','FormE2023SAS0124','5101','9104','You have submitted the explanation that the main project is completed and thus Commencement certificate for Mega project cannot be submitted. Even though the entire JLPL project is complete and it was exempted from completion vide letter of GMADA dated 20.04.2015 you are seeking extension for your incomplete project and since it is a part of a Mega project you have to submit the Extension in implementation period in Mega Project or any other document which shows the validation only of your specific project granted by the Government in which the time limit is extended at least up to the date of the extension required under section 6 of the Act. You have submitted the agreement between Government and JLPL. You are again asked to provide a valid document as requested for approval of extension u/s 6 of the act.','N','','','',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:27:30.000','os.projects1','2024-01-10 16:27:30.000'),(4753,'amfnarera','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','2024-01-11 09:56:13.000',1476,10574,'FormE2023LDH0109','FormE2023LDH0109','5105','9105','Requisite fees received.  ','Y','','','',1,0,'amfnarera','2024-01-11 09:56:13.000','amfnarera','2024-01-11 09:56:13.000'),(4754,'amfnarera','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','2024-01-11 10:00:25.000',1295,10340,'FormE2023PTK0114','FormE2023PTK0114','5105','9105','Requisite fees received. ','Y','','','',1,0,'amfnarera','2024-01-11 10:00:25.000','amfnarera','2024-01-11 10:00:25.000'),(4755,'amfnarera','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','2024-01-11 10:01:10.000',1094,10461,'FormE2023SAS0081','FormE2023SAS0081','5105','9105','Requisite fees received.  ','Y','','','',1,0,'amfnarera','2024-01-11 10:01:10.000','amfnarera','2024-01-11 10:01:10.000'),(4756,'amfnarera','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','2024-01-11 10:02:53.000',1637,10777,'FormE2023SAS0103','FormE2023SAS0103','5105','9105','Requisite