ssion / approval is valid upto 5 years i.e. till 22.07.2025 as per Clause 5. It is further provided in clause 5 of the permit that if the construction is not completed within two years from the date of approval of building permit, then the said permission shall stand cancelled without any notice. Therefore, you are asked to provide NOC regarding the same','N','','','',2,0,'excgen4','2025-02-17 15:03:13.000','excgen4','2025-02-17 15:03:13.000'),(5975,'excgen4','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2025-02-17 15:19:28.000',1648,10788,'FormE2023SAS0134','FormE2023SAS0134','5101','9104','Please provide the building permit getting the plans revalidated from the competent authority or NOC form EO/ Competent authority.','N','','','',2,0,'excgen4','2025-02-17 15:19:28.000','excgen4','2025-02-17 15:19:28.000'),(5976,'excgen4','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2025-02-17 15:19:55.000',1648,10788,'FormE2023SAS0134','FormE2023SAS0134','5101','9102','Building plans were approved in year 2006 and after 18 years the project is still not completed as per the progress report submitted by the promoter. The builder is not serious in completing the project and has applied for extension after 11 months of lapse of registration. His claim that the project has been delayed for no fault of his is not acceptable. You need give a detailed plan how you plan to complete the project in time bound fashion supported with fund flow statement to ensure timely completion','N','','','',2,0,'excgen4','2025-02-17 15:19:55.000','excgen4','2025-02-17 15:19:55.000'),(5977,'excgen4','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2025-02-19 12:41:12.000',2211,11349,'FormE2025SAS0008','FormE2025SAS0008','5101','9104','Promoter/ applicant provided NOC from EO MC Zirakpur ','Y','','','',2,0,'excgen4','2025-02-19 12:41:12.000','excgen4','2025-02-19 12:41:12.000'),(5978,'excgen4','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','2025-02-19 12:42:11.000',2284,11415,'FormE2025SAS0007','FormE2025SAS0007','5101','9104','Prom